  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfenced><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>n</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and if the roots of the equation <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> are <math><mi>α</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is equal to (where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;denotes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts></math>)"
  },
